      <activity id="e3c69993-9838-5342-bf5e-243dd8ff29de" activityNameId="cd215520-7de6-50d9-9d5a-a5ba48adbdc5" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, maintenance, railway track, ICE</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, maintenance, railway track, ICE
Inventory for a ballastless track bedding. ;
UUID: bce4f41e-dda4-3961-a5b5-50b723c1f1a4
The inventory includes the energy consumption required for the operation of the rail track as well as the operation of tunnels. The use and emissions to soil of herbicides (weed control) and lubricates (point maintenance) are taken into account. Also land transformation and occupation are accounted for.
Location: Data refers to specific ICE railway track.
Technology: Data represents new  technologies
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bce4f41e-dda4-3961-a5b5-50b723c1f1a4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
